#: kcmlayout.cpp:91
msgid "&Enable keyboard layouts"
msgstr "&Uključi rasporede tastature"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:92
msgid ""
"Here you can completely disable this module, for example if you use other "
"tools for switching keyboard layouts."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete potpuno isključiti ovaj modul, npr. ako koristite neki drugi "
"alat za promjenu rasporeda tipaka na tastaturi."

#: kcmlayout.cpp:107
msgid "Keyboard &model:"
msgstr "&Model tastature:"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:110
msgid ""
"Here you can choose a keyboard model. This setting is independent of your "
"keyboard layout and refers to the \"hardware\" model, i.e. the way your "
"keyboard is manufactured. Modern keyboards that come with your computer "
"usually have two extra keys and are referred to as \"104-key\" models, which "
"is probably what you want if you don't know what kind of keyboard you have."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete izabrati model vaše tastature. Ova postavka je nezavisna od "
"raporeda tipaka i odnosi se na \"hardverski\" model, tj. način na koji je "
"vaša tastatura napravljena. Savremene tastature koje dolaze uz računare "
"obično imaju dvije dodatne tipke i nazivaju se \"104-tipke\" modeli, što "
"je vjerovatno najbolji izbor ako ne znate koju vrstu tastature imate."

#: kcmlayout.cpp:120
msgid "Pr&imary layout:"
msgstr "Pr&imarni raspored:"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:123
msgid ""
"Here you can choose your primary keyboard layout, i.e. the keyboard layout "
"used as default. The keyboard layout defines \"which keys do what\". For "
"example German keyboards have the letter 'Y' where US keyboards have the "
"letter 'Z'."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete izabrati vaš primarni raspored tipki, npr. raspored koji se "
"koristi kao podrazumjevani. Raspored tipki definiše \"koje tipke želite\". "
"Na primjer, njemačke tastature imaju slovo 'Y' tamo gdje američke "
"tastature imaju 'Z'."

#: kcmlayout.cpp:133
msgid "Prim&ary variant:"
msgstr "Prim&arna varijanta:"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:136
msgid ""
"Here you can choose a variant of your primary keyboard layout. Layout "
"variants usually represent different key maps for the same language. For "
"example, Ukrainian layout might have four variants: basic, winkeys (as in "
"Windows), typewriter (as in typewriters) and phonetic (each Ukrainian letter "
"is placed on a transliterated latin one)."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete odabrati varijantu vašeg primarnog rasporeda tipki. Varijante "
"raposreda obično predstavljaju različite mape tipki za isti jezik. Npr. "
"ukrajinski raspored može imati četiri varijante: osnovnu, winkeys (kao u "
"Windowsu), typewriter (kao na pisaćim mašinama) i fonetičku (svako "
"ukrajinsko slovo je smješteno na transliteriranom latiničnom)."

#: kcmlayout.cpp:147
msgid "Additional Layouts"
msgstr "Dodatni rasporedi"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:151
msgid ""
"You can select an arbitrary number of additional keyboard layouts. If one or "
"more additional layouts have been selected, the KDE panel will offer a "
"docked flag. By clicking on this flag you can easily switch between layouts."
msgstr ""
"Možete izabrati proizvoljan broj dodatnih rasporeda tastature. Ako je jedan "
"ili više rasporeda izabrano, KDE panel će prikazati zastavu. Klikanjem na "
"tu zastavu možete jednostavno prebacivati između rasporeda."

#: kcmlayout.cpp:155
msgid "Switching Policy"
msgstr "Politika prebacivanja"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:158
msgid "&Global"
msgstr "&Globalno"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:159
msgid "Application"
msgstr "Aplikacija"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:160
msgid "&Window"
msgstr "&Prozor"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:173
msgid "Flag"
msgstr "Zastava"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:174
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "Raspored"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:175
msgid "Keymap"
msgstr "Keymap"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:186
msgid "&Variant:"
msgstr "&Varijanta:"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:190
msgid ""
"Here you can choose a variant of the selected additional keyboard layout. "
"Layout variants usually represent different key maps for the same language. "
"For example, Ukrainian layout might have four variants: basic, winkeys (as "
"in Windows), typewriter (as in typewriters) and phonetic (each Ukrainian "
"letter is placed on a transliterated latin one)."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete izabrati varijantu izabranog dodatnog rasporeda tipki. "
"Varijante raposreda obično predstavljaju različite mape tipki za isti "
"jezik. Npr. ukrajinski raspored može imati četiri varijante: osnovnu, "
"winkeys (kao u Windowsu), typewriter (kao na pisaćim mašinama) i "
"fonetičku (svako ukrajinsko slovo je smješteno na transliteriranom "
"latiničnom)."

#: kcmlayout.cpp:207
msgid "&Layout"
msgstr "&Raspored"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:306
msgid "Xkb Options"
msgstr "Xkb opcije"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:309
msgid "&Reset old options"
msgstr "&Vrati stare opcije"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:600
msgid ""
"<h1>Keyboard Layout & Model</h1> Here you can choose your keyboard layout "
"and model. The 'model' refers to the type of keyboard that is connected to "
"your computer, while the keyboard layout defines \"which key does what\" and "
"may be different for different countries."
"<p> In addition to the 'Primary Layout', which will be used as the default, "
"you can specify additional layouts, which you can easily switch between "
"using the KDE panel."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Raspored tastature i model</h1>"
" Ovdje možete izabrati raspored tipki na vašoj tastatur i model. 'Model' "
"se odnosi na tip tastature koja je povezana na vaš računar, dok raspored "
"tipki definiše \"šta radi koja tipka\" i može biti različit u raznim "
"zemljama."
"<p>"
" Pored 'Primarnog rasporeda', koji se koristi kao podrazumjevani, možete "
"navesti dodatne rasporede, koje možete jednostavno mijenjati koristeći KDE "
"panel."

